    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index was up 761 points from last week to 4,792. SSY’s assessed W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate increased $0.90/t to $7.75/t. The round-voyage rate is now similar to the levels seen last year, increasing $4,250/day on the week to $10,500/day.",
